{"seq":3,"slug":"architecture-decision-mobile","title":"架构决策与文档化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/architecture-decision-mobile","wordCount":1241,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"架构决策与文档化\">架构决策与文档化</h1><p>架构决策是移动团队最昂贵的认知产出——一个错误的状态管理方案选型可能在六个月后导致全面重构。但大多数团队的架构决策存在于口头讨论、Slack 消息和会议纪要中，三个月后已无人记得&quot;当初为什么选了这个方案&quot;。Architecture Decision Record（ADR）是一种轻量级文档格式，专门用于捕获架构决策的上下文、选项、取舍和结论——让决策可追溯、可复盘、可传承。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>ADR 格式</strong>：Context → Decision → Consequences 的轻量级文档，捕获架构决策的&quot;为什么&quot;而非&quot;是什么&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>不可删除原则</strong>：ADR 一旦 Accepted 永远不删除，只能被 Superseded 或 Deprecated——历史可追溯性是最大价值</li>\n<li><strong>可逆性分析</strong>：单向门决策（UI 框架、模块化拓扑）需要充分评估；双向门决策可以快速执行、快速调整</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"adr-的最小结构\">ADR 的最小结构</h2><p>Michael Nygard 在 2011 年提出的 ADR 格式极其精简，一条 ADR 通常 50-150 行 Markdown：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>字数参考</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Title</td>\n<td><code>ADR-NNN: 简短决策描述</code></td>\n<td>一句话</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Status</td>\n<td>Proposed / Accepted / Deprecated / Superseded</td>\n<td>一个词</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Context</td>\n<td>决策背景：我们面临什么问题？约束是什么？</td>\n<td>3-5 句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decision</td>\n<td>我们决定做什么</td>\n<td>1-3 句</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Consequences</td>\n<td>正面和负面后果</td>\n<td>3-7 条</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# ADR-003: 采用 MVI 作为 Presentation 层架构模式&#10;&#10;## Status&#10;&#10;Accepted (2026-03-15)&#10;&#10;## Context&#10;&#10;应用已有 40+ 个页面采用 MVVM，但多个 ViewModel 存在以下问题：&#10;&#10;- 状态分散在 5-8 个 StateFlow 中，调试时难以重现完整屏幕状态&#10;- 副作用（导航、Toast）与状态更新混合在同一方法中&#10;- 新人需要 2-3 周才能理解一个复杂 ViewModel 的数据流&#10;&#10;团队规模从 5 人增长到 15 人，需要更严格的约定来保持代码一致性。&#10;&#10;## Decision&#10;&#10;新页面统一采用 MVI 模式（sealed Intent + 单一 UiState + Effect Channel）。&#10;旧页面在需要修改时逐步迁移（Strangler Fig 策略）。&#10;&#10;## Consequences&#10;&#10;- (+) 屏幕状态成为可序列化的快照，支持 Snapshot Testing&#10;- (+) 统一的 Intent → Reduce → State 流程降低新人上手成本&#10;- (+) Effect 与 State 分离，消除&quot;配置变更后重复导航&quot;的 Bug 类&#10;- (-) 简单页面的 boilerplate 增加约 20 行&#10;- (-) 团队需要 2 周学习期适应 sealed Intent 的枚举方式&#10;- (-) 旧 MVVM 页面与新 MVI 页面共存期间存在两种模式\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># ADR-003: 采用 MVI 作为 Presentation 层架构模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Accepted (2026-03-15)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">应用已有 40+ 个页面采用 MVVM，但多个 ViewModel 存在以下问题：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 状态分散在 5-8 个 StateFlow 中，调试时难以重现完整屏幕状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 副作用（导航、Toast）与状态更新混合在同一方法中</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> 新人需要 2-3 周才能理解一个复杂 ViewModel 的数据流</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">团队规模从 5 人增长到 15 人，需要更严格的约定来保持代码一致性。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Decision</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">新页面统一采用 MVI 模式（sealed Intent + 单一 UiState + Effect Channel）。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">旧页面在需要修改时逐步迁移（Strangler Fig 策略）。</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Consequences</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (+) 屏幕状态成为可序列化的快照，支持 Snapshot Testing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (+) 统一的 Intent → Reduce → State 流程降低新人上手成本</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (+) Effect 与 State 分离，消除\"配置变更后重复导航\"的 Bug 类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (-) 简单页面的 boilerplate 增加约 20 行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (-) 团队需要 2 周学习期适应 sealed Intent 的枚举方式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (-) 旧 MVVM 页面与新 MVI 页面共存期间存在两种模式</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"adr-的生命周期管理\">ADR 的生命周期管理</h2><p>ADR 不是一次性文档——它有生命周期：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; Proposed: 起草&#10;    Proposed --&gt; Accepted: 团队共识&#10;    Proposed --&gt; Rejected: 否决&#10;    Accepted --&gt; Deprecated: 不再适用&#10;    Accepted --&gt; Superseded: 被新 ADR 替代&#10;    Deprecated --&gt; [*]&#10;    Superseded --&gt; [*]&#10;    Rejected --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; Proposed: 起草\n    Proposed --&gt; Accepted: 团队共识\n    Proposed --&gt; Rejected: 否决\n    Accepted --&gt; Deprecated: 不再适用\n    Accepted --&gt; Superseded: 被新 ADR 替代\n    Deprecated --&gt; [*]\n    Superseded --&gt; [*]\n    Rejected --&gt; [*]</pre><p><strong>关键规则：ADR 一旦 Accepted，永远不删除——只能被 Superseded 或 Deprecated。</strong> 历史记录是最大的价值——六个月后你需要知道&quot;为什么当时没选 X&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"移动端常见架构决策目录\">移动端常见架构决策目录</h2><p>一个典型的移动项目需要做出以下架构决策（按时间线排列）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>决策主题</th>\n<th>影响范围</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>项目启动</td>\n<td>UI 框架选型（Compose vs XML / SwiftUI vs UIKit）</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目启动</td>\n<td>架构模式（MVVM / MVI / TCA）</td>\n<td>Presentation 层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目启动</td>\n<td>模块化策略（单模块 / 按层 / 按 Feature）</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>项目启动</td>\n<td>DI 框架（Hilt / Koin / 手动）</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>早期</td>\n<td>网络层（Retrofit / Ktor / URLSession）</td>\n<td>Data 层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>早期</td>\n<td>本地存储（Room / SQLDelight / CoreData / SwiftData）</td>\n<td>Data 层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中期</td>\n<td>导航方案（Navigation Compose / NavigationStack）</td>\n<td>全局</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中期</td>\n<td>状态持久化策略（SavedStateHandle / SceneStorage）</td>\n<td>Presentation 层</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>第三方库引入/替换</td>\n<td>局部</td>\n<td>取决于抽象层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续</td>\n<td>API 版本策略</td>\n<td>Data 层</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"决策评估框架-daci-权衡矩阵\">决策评估框架：DACI + 权衡矩阵</h2><h3 id=\"daci-角色\">DACI 角色</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>角色</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n<th>人数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Driver</td>\n<td>推动决策流程、收集信息</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Approver</td>\n<td>最终拍板</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Contributor</td>\n<td>提供意见和方案</td>\n<td>2-5</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Informed</td>\n<td>被告知结果</td>\n<td>不限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"权衡矩阵\">权衡矩阵</h3><p>对于重大决策，量化比较多个方案：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"## 权衡矩阵：状态管理方案选型&#10;&#10;| 维度 (权重)       | MVVM 多 Flow | MVI 单 State |   TCA    |&#10;| ----------------- | :----------: | :----------: | :------: |&#10;| 学习曲线 (15%)    |      9       |      7       |    5     |&#10;| 可测试性 (25%)    |      6       |      8       |    10    |&#10;| 调试体验 (20%)    |      5       |      8       |    9     |&#10;| Boilerplate (10%) |      8       |      6       |    5     |&#10;| 生态成熟度 (15%)  |      9       |      8       |    7     |&#10;| 跨平台复用 (15%)  |      5       |      7       |    4     |&#10;| **加权总分**      |   **6.65**   |   **7.55**   | **7.15** |\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## 权衡矩阵：状态管理方案选型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| 维度 (权重)       | MVVM 多 Flow | MVI 单 State |   TCA    |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| ----------------- | :----------: | :----------: | :------: |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| 学习曲线 (15%)    |      9       |      7       |    5     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| 可测试性 (25%)    |      6       |      8       |    10    |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| 调试体验 (20%)    |      5       |      8       |    9     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| Boilerplate (10%) |      8       |      6       |    5     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| 生态成熟度 (15%)  |      9       |      8       |    7     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| 跨平台复用 (15%)  |      5       |      7       |    4     |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">| </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**加权总分**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      |   </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**6.65**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   |   </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**7.55**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">   | </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**7.15**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> |</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Score</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Score} = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i \\times s_i, \\quad \\sum w_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Score</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6em;vertical-align:-0.55em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"架构文档的层次结构\">架构文档的层次结构</h2><p>ADR 只是架构文档体系的一部分。完整的移动端架构文档应包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"docs/architecture/&#10;├── overview.md           # 架构全景图（1 页纸）&#10;├── principles.md         # 架构原则（5-10 条）&#10;├── decisions/            # ADR 目录&#10;│   ├── 001-ui-framework.md&#10;│   ├── 002-modularization.md&#10;│   ├── 003-mvi-pattern.md&#10;│   └── ...&#10;├── guidelines/           # 实施指南&#10;│   ├── module-creation.md&#10;│   ├── state-management.md&#10;│   └── testing-strategy.md&#10;└── diagrams/             # 架构图（C4 模型）&#10;    ├── context.md        # L1: 系统上下文&#10;    ├── container.md      # L2: 容器（App + API + DB）&#10;    └── component.md      # L3: 组件（模块依赖图）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>docs/architecture/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── overview.md           # 架构全景图（1 页纸）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── principles.md         # 架构原则（5-10 条）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── decisions/            # ADR 目录</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 001-ui-framework.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 002-modularization.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── 003-mvi-pattern.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── guidelines/           # 实施指南</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── module-creation.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── state-management.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── testing-strategy.md</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── diagrams/             # 架构图（C4 模型）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── context.md        # L1: 系统上下文</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── container.md      # L2: 容器（App + API + DB）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── component.md      # L3: 组件（模块依赖图）</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"架构健康度度量\">架构健康度度量</h2><p>将架构原则转化为可量化的指标，在 CI 中持续监控：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>健康阈值</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>模块间耦合度</td>\n<td>跨模块 import 数 / 总 import 数</td>\n<td>&lt; 15%</td>\n<td>ArchUnit / dependency-analysis-plugin</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>循环依赖</td>\n<td>模块依赖图中的环数</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>Gradle 插件 / 自定义脚本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大模块体积</td>\n<td>最大模块代码行数 / 平均模块行数</td>\n<td>&lt; 3x</td>\n<td>cloc</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试覆盖分布</td>\n<td>Domain 层覆盖率 / 整体覆盖率</td>\n<td>Domain &gt; 80%</td>\n<td>JaCoCo / Xcode Coverage</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ADR 覆盖率</td>\n<td>有 ADR 的重大决策数 / 总重大决策数</td>\n<td>&gt; 90%</td>\n<td>人工审查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>架构健康指数</mtext><mo>=</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><mfrac><msub><mtext>actual</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mtext>threshold</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{架构健康指数} = \\prod_{i=1}^{n} \\frac{\\text{actual}_i}{\\text{threshold}_i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">架构健康指数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.9291em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">threshold</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">actual</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>指数 &gt; 1 表示健康，&lt; 1 表示需要关注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决策的可逆性分析\">决策的可逆性分析</h2><p>Jeff Bezos 的&quot;单向门 vs 双向门&quot;框架在架构决策中特别有用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>单向门</strong>（不可逆）：UI 框架选型、数据库选型、模块化拓扑——错了成本极高，需要充分评估</li>\n<li><strong>双向门</strong>（可逆）：具体库版本、API 调用方式、状态管理细节——可以快速决策、快速调整</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>决策投入时间</mtext><mo>∝</mo><mtext>不可逆程度</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>影响范围</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{决策投入时间} \\propto \\text{不可逆程度} \\times \\text{影响范围}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">决策投入时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∝</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不可逆程度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">影响范围</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>对于单向门决策，投入 1-2 周做 Spike/PoC（Proof of Concept）是合理的；对于双向门决策，30 分钟讨论后直接执行。</p>\n<p>架构决策文档化与 <a href=\"legacy-migration-patterns\">遗留代码迁移</a> 紧密配合——每次迁移决策都应有对应的 ADR 记录；而 ADR 中引用的技术评估则依赖 <a href=\"architecture-testing-strategies\">架构测试策略</a> 提供的数据支撑。三者共同构成了移动端架构的工程治理闭环。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>架构决策文档化的价值不在于&quot;写了一份文档&quot;，而在于&quot;六个月后还能回答&#39;当时为什么选了这个方案&#39;&quot;。ADR 的 Context-Decision-Consequences 三段式结构以最小成本捕获决策的完整上下文。权衡矩阵量化了多方案对比，DACI 明确了决策角色。将架构健康度指标（耦合度、循环依赖、模块体积）接入 CI 监控，让架构治理从&quot;人工审查&quot;升级为&quot;自动化门禁&quot;。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"架构决策与文档化","id":"架构决策与文档化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"ADR 的最小结构","id":"adr-的最小结构"},{"level":2,"text":"ADR 的生命周期管理","id":"adr-的生命周期管理"},{"level":2,"text":"移动端常见架构决策目录","id":"移动端常见架构决策目录"},{"level":2,"text":"决策评估框架：DACI + 权衡矩阵","id":"决策评估框架-daci-权衡矩阵"},{"level":3,"text":"DACI 角色","id":"daci-角色"},{"level":3,"text":"权衡矩阵","id":"权衡矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"架构文档的层次结构","id":"架构文档的层次结构"},{"level":2,"text":"架构健康度度量","id":"架构健康度度量"},{"level":2,"text":"决策的可逆性分析","id":"决策的可逆性分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"遗留代码迁移模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/mobile-architecture-patterns/practice/legacy-migration-patterns"},"next":null}